node_modules/
_build/
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.log
*.out
.vigiles/state/

# 🔴 The pipeline's reproduction logs are EVIDENCE, not build output. `*.log` above is a LaTeX rule
# (`paper.log`), and it silently swallowed all 13 files under skills/paper-pipeline/repro/ when they
# arrived — a commit would have carried the eval claims and none of the raw runs behind them, which is
# the exact artifact loss `repro/` exists to prevent. Measured at the moment of the move, not guessed:
# `git check-ignore -v` named this line for every one of them.
!skills/paper-pipeline/repro/*.log

# Замок взаимного исключения прогонов (scripts/exclusive.mjs) — живёт только на время прогона.
.vigiles/exclusive.lock/
